        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to expanding the network, we are scaling other fee-based service offerings that we anticipate will generate a growing stream of recurring revenue, including our assessments service and our new Care Plans service, which launched in the second quarter of 2025.",
        "start_character": 5176,
        "end_character": 5446
      },
      {
